          "en": "The Harvard crews' training stretch: from the Newell Boathouse under the Anderson Memorial Bridge, past the red-roofed Weld Boathouse and along the red-brick Harvard houses with their bell towers. Under the Weeks Footbridge, Western Avenue and River Street you row downstream to the lawns of Magazine Beach in Cambridge, turn there and come back to the boathouses."
